libregexp (vendored, Linux test build only)
===========================================

Origin:   9front /sys/src/libregexp, copied from the author's 9front VM with
          dircp into src/tools/libregexp (user-supplied; copy made 2026-07-25
          per the preserved timestamps, taken into this repository 2026-10-11).
          The 9front commit was not recorded.
Licence:  MIT (the 9front/Plan 9 libregexp licence).
Use:      ONLY by the Linux test build (src/Makefile builds test/librx.a from
          these sources so the goldens run the same engine as the VM).
          9front builds link the system libregexp; the shipped coil binary
          never contains this copy.
Status:   the .c and .h files are unmodified copies. Linux needs the shims in
          src/tools/rx9 (u.h, libc.h, regexp.h, rx9.c).

